Necochea&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;Pinamar&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;Villa Gesell&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;La Costa&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;Mar del Plata&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;La Plata&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;Berisso&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;General Rodríguez&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;9 de Julio&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;Carmen de Patagones&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;Cañuelas&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;Azul&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;Baradero&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;Bragados&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;Coronel Dorrego&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;Coronel Suárez&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;General Villegas&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;San Miguel del Monte&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;Tres Arroyos&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;Chivilcoy&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;Marcos Paz&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;Juan José Castelli&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;Lincoln&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;Ramallo&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;Rojas&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;San Vicente&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;Villa Ocampo&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;Bella Vista&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;Chacabuco&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;Mercedes&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;Exaltación de la Cruz&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;General Alvear&apos;, &#13;&#10;                    &apos;Gral. José de San Martín&apos;)&#13;&#10;THEN &quot;Camila Buasso&quot;&#13;&#10;ELSE&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;    IF NOT ISNULL([xPartnerID])&#13;&#10;    THEN [Agente de Performance (Partner)]&#13;&#10;    ELSE&#13;&#10;        IF NOT ISNULL([xFranchise])&#13;&#10;        THEN [Agente de Performance (KA)]&#13;&#10;        ELSE &#13;&#10;            IF NOT ISNULL([xCity])&#13;&#10;            THEN [Agente de Performance (City)]&#13;&#10;            ELSE&#13;&#10;                IF NOT ISNULL([xArea])&#13;&#10;                THEN [Agente de Performance (Area)]&#13;&#10;                ELSE &quot;Error de Asignación&quot;&#13;&#10;                END&#13;&#10;            END&#13;&#10;        END&#13;&#10;    END&#13;&#10;END' />
